# Dependencies
node_modules/

# dist/ IS COMMITTED ON PURPOSE — do not add it here.
#
# FlexDesk's packaging decision is "prebuilt dist": this repo owns the esbuild
# build and commits its output, so a consumer with no bundler — EcoAgent has no
# package.json, no node_modules and no build step — can load the library through a
# plain import map. Ignoring dist/ would break exactly the consumer this library
# was extracted for.

